@startuml
' Figure 13.4  Version pin, alias and deprecation timeline
' Reading order: top to bottom in time. The step called an alias; the
' alias moved on April 7, 2026; the nightly run on April 8 caught it
' and the step was pinned to the dated snapshot.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Step" as S <<ops>>
participant "Alias" as A <<model>>
participant "Snapshot" as D <<model>>
actor "On-call" as B <<org>>
S -> A : April 1 run
A -> D : dated
D --> S : 16 of 16
note over A : April 7\nrepointed
S -> A : April 8 run
A -[$FAIL]-> S : newer, 0 of 16
S -[$FAIL]-> B : alert
B -> D : pin dated ID
note over D : retires after\n60 days' notice
@enduml
